<title>USA: IBM licenses Voxware technology.</title>
<headline>IBM licenses Voxware technology.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, N.J. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voxware Inc said Tuesday that International Business Machines Corp has licensed its MetaSound audio compression technologies (codecs) for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>Voxware, a developer of speech and audio compression technologies, said its MetaSound technology is designed to deliver high quality audio over bandwidth-constrained environments.</p>
<p>IBM said it plans to incorporate Voxware's solution into its Internet technology portfolio to help customers achieve more &quot;natural&quot; human interaction on the World Wide Web.</p>
</text>
